WEBVTT

00:03:28.625 --> 00:03:30.976
It says, "Hey, guys, stand down.

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:32.518
Folks, it's over."

00:03:32.542 --> 00:03:34.476
Moreover, that concession speech

00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:39.559
helps the tens of millions of people
who voted for that person

00:03:39.583 --> 00:03:41.309
to accept the outcome.

00:03:41.333 --> 00:03:44.018
Acknowledge the winner,
however begrudgingly,

00:03:44.042 --> 00:03:45.851
and then just get up the next morning,

00:03:45.875 --> 00:03:47.143
go to work, go to school,

00:03:47.167 --> 00:03:48.434
maybe disappointed

00:03:48.458 --> 00:03:51.393
but not disloyal to America's government.

00:03:51.417 --> 00:03:53.309
And even more importantly,

00:03:53.333 --> 00:03:55.809
that concession speech
has a technical function

00:03:55.833 --> 00:03:58.226
in that it kind of allows
all the other stuff

00:03:58.250 --> 00:04:00.643
that our constitution requires
after the voting,